        "3. Failure Criteria & Factor of Safety:",
        "Compare maximum shear stress $\\tau_{\\max} = \\frac{\\sigma_1 - \\sigma_3}{2}$ against Tresca/Von Mises yield thresholds, maintaining $SF = \\frac{\\sigma_y}{\\sigma_{allow}} \\ge 1.5$.",
